{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TIDY UP YOUR LOCAL NEBULA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy waves of enemies and bosses in this arena action roguelike shooter where each weapon alters your ships temperature. Superheat or Superchill your ship to use powerful thermal special attacks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DUAL TEMPERATURE WARFARE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every weapon is heat or cold based and changes the temperature of your ship as destroy enemies. Various effects from the nebula and other factors will change your ship's temperature as well! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR WEAPONRY</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 30 ways to upgrade your ship! Gain new abilities, weapons and system upgrades that affect multiple weapons and your ship's overall speed, recovery and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UNLOCK PERMANENT UPGRADES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and equip permanent mods to your ship to become stronger from the start of your nebula run!\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3432070?t=1742612407","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/0e0da7569b9627ecb7263299766e41ab97cb5233/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742612407","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/1d0caf88b0fc4cf9ccaefd4b0811af3d5cd2b37f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742612407","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432070/1d0caf88b0fc4cf9ccaefd4b0811af3d5cd2b37f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742612407","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TIDY UP YOUR LOCAL NEBULA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy waves of enemies and bosses in this arena action roguelike sh